OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fmostly dry evening, but the odd shower
OL,7,Fcannot be ruled out, mainly across
OL,8,Fnorthern hills. Otherwise staying dry,
OL,9,Fwith clouds breaking after midnight to
OL,10,Fgive the odd clearer spell, especially
OL,11,Ffurther south. Mainly light winds.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FA largely fine and dry day.
OL,14,FOccasional sunny spells are likely,
OL,15,Fespecially at first, although some
OL,16,Fcloud will build through the day.
OL,17,FLight winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
