OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FSunny
OL,6,Fspells Saturday and Sunday, and likely
OL,7,Fturning very warm again. Perhaps the
OL,8,Fodd overnight shower, but otherwise
OL,9,Fdry. Cloudier for a time Monday and
OL,10,Fperhaps a touch cooler.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
